    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061203.0332\n\nDOHA, Dec 3 , 2006, 2006\n\nJapan's Nakamura wins women's 200m backstroke gold medal\n\n\n\n\nJapan's Reiko Nakamura won the women's 200m backstroke gold medal at the Asian Games here Sunday in a time of 2:10.33.\n\nZhao Jing of China took the silver with Takami Igarashi of Japan winning bronze.",
